{
  "uid": "gate-atla-in",
  "title": "gate.atla.in · Availability",
  "description": "Monitoring for https://gate.atla.in/.",
  "tags": [
    "gate.atla.in",
    "measured"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "15m",
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "CloudWatch",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "cloudwatch",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "prom",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "/grafanacloud-.*-prom/",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "sm_job",
        "label": "Uptime check",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "gate.atla.in homepage",
        "hide": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Availability",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Status now",
      "description": "Whether the latest run of the uptime check succeeded from every probe. Measured · Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check \"${sm_job}\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prom}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prom}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(probe_success{job=\"${sm_job}\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Status now"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "displayName": "Status now",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "No check"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "description": "Share of check runs that succeeded over the selected range, across all probes. Measured · Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check \"${sm_job}\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prom}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prom}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg(avg_over_time(probe_success{job=\"${sm_job}\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Uptime"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "displayName": "Uptime",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.999
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "No check"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Check duration",
      "description": "Average time for one check run (DNS, connect, TLS, response) over the selected range. Measured · Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check \"${sm_job}\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prom}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prom}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg(avg_over_time(probe_duration_seconds{job=\"${sm_job}\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Check duration"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "displayName": "Check duration",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "No check"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed check runs",
      "description": "Check runs that failed over the selected range, across all probes. Measured · Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check \"${sm_job}\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prom}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prom}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(probe_all_success_count{job=\"${sm_job}\"}[$__range])) - sum(increase(probe_all_success_sum{job=\"${sm_job}\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Failed"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "displayName": "Failed check runs",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "No check"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this data",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Signal type:** Measured. Every panel's ⓘ names its source.\n\n**Site:** `https://gate.atla.in/`. LLM gateway: FastAPI on one EC2 t4g.small (Docker Compose, Caddy TLS) in ap-south-1, in front of Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini and Amazon Bedrock. gita.atla.in and the atla.in chatbot call models through it. No CloudFront, load balancer or WAF.\n\n**Availability:** Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check `gate.atla.in homepage`, every 5 minutes from 3 probes.\n\n**Gateway usage:** the gateway's own Grafana (on its host, provisioned from the gate repo) reads its audit log directly. Aggregate totals are public at `https://gate.atla.in/v1/stats` and shown on obs.atla.in; Grafana Cloud has no route to the gateway's database.\n\n**Not shown:** real-visitor data (no RUM on this site); firewall data (no AWS WAF in front of this site); deploy markers; request logs (not collected)."
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    }
  ]
}
